  "title": "JSON Dictionary: Plug leaks",
  "description": "Since the path is required, and possibly created from the name, don't\nretrieve the other attributes until we know if we have path. This saves\nhaving to free them if they don't exist. We don't need to free the name\nif it's NULL.\n\nAlso free the other properties in field_def from xmlGetProp.\n\nFix #21162\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
